+BOARDNAME:=Hurricane 2 (BCM5334x switches)
+
+define Target/Description
+	Broadcom Hurricane 2 (BCM53342/3/4/6) switch SoCs, e.g. UniFi US-48-500W.
+	Initramfs/serial bring-up only: no switch-fabric driver yet.
+endef
